// Enumerable registry surface names parallel to builtin_function_registry keys. Witness-time census
// cannot call map_keys on Map<String, Node> because Node is not a runtime Value. Relocated from
// v1.compiler.infer_method for dag/ compile scope (review 46064) — same parallel-enumeration debt,
// not a new fork. Dissolve-on: fold builtin_function_registry construction from this list as the
// single authority.
// DRIFT IS NOW MEASURED, NOT PREDICTED: gunbc.primitive_egress.census_live reads the authority's
// key set through the builtin_function_registry_keys compiler query and prints both set
// differences (hand_roster_missing_registry_rows / hand_roster_rows_absent_from_registry) in every
// census receipt (`gunbc test //gunbc/instruments:primitive-egress-census-v2`); the receipt, not
